          "short": "$5\\sqrt2$",
          "worked": "The angle between the sides of lengths $5$ and $4$ is $180^{\\circ}-50^{\\circ}-85^{\\circ}=45^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}A&=\\frac12 ab\\sin C\\\\A&=\\frac12(5)(4)\\sin45^{\\circ}\\\\A&=10\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\right)\\\\A&=5\\sqrt2\\end{align*}$$",
