        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{15\\sqrt2}{4}$",
          "worked": "$\\sin135^{\\circ}=\\sin45^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}A&=\\frac12 ab\\sin C\\\\A&=\\frac12(5)(3)\\sin135^{\\circ}\\\\A&=\\frac{15}{2}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\right)\\\\A&=\\frac{15\\sqrt2}{4}\\end{align*}$$",
